{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015Ns7WM9fAtgBxCsRg9wpNB","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: '核心叙事从 ''strategy-specific phase interaction'' 重构为 ''universal\n2\t  phase vulnerability in compound sparsity''。GPQA 数据显示 random eviction 产生与 importance\n3\t  可比拟的 phase gradient (ratio <1.5×)，且 importance gradient 在 s025→s030 出现 non-monotonicity。Strategy\n4\t  specificity 仅在 MATH-500 DeepSeek 上强 (15-17×)，其余条件均 ≤3×。新 angle: phase vulnerability\n5\t  universality 本身是 novel characterization；recency 作为唯一 phase-robust strategy 的 practical\n6\t  implication；discrimination collapse 解释 importance≥random 的微弱优势。'\n7\timagined_experiments:\n8\t- name: gpqa_ds_importance_s020\n9\t  plan_id: gpqa_ds_importance_s020\n10\t  description: GPQA importance masking s=0.20, DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B, n=198\n11\t  expected_results:\n12\t    n_problems: 198\n13\t    high_median_ii: 0.035\n14\t    mid_median_ii: 0.28\n15\t    low_median_ii: 1.85\n16\t    median_diff_low_minus_high: 1.815\n17\t    wilcoxon_p: 2.5e-28\n18\t    cohens_dz: 0.72\n19\t    ci_low: 1.52\n20\t    ci_high: 2.18\n21\t    monotonic: true\n22\t    phase_gradient_direction: low > mid > high\n23\t    median_ratio_low_high: 52.9\n24\t  result_rationale: GPQA 问题的推理链平均 ~6000 tokens (远长于 MATH-500 ~1200)，导致 low-sparsity\n25\t    phase 中可被 evict 的 critical token 绝对数量远多于 MATH-500。s020 compound interaction 在\n26\t    GPQA 上产生 median_diff ~1.8，虽然方向与 MATH-500 一致 (MATH-500 s020=1.21)，但增长率从 MATH-500\n27\t    的 s015→s020 3.1× 压缩为 GPQA 的 1.9×。原因：GPQA 多学科内容 (physics/chem/bio) 的 attention\n28\t    pattern 比纯数学推理更分散，head pruning 后的 discrimination collapse 在 s015 时已较充分——进一步增加\n29\t    sparsity 的边际 collapse 效应递减。\n30\t  tables:\n31\t  - name: GPQA DS Importance s020 Phase II\n32\t    columns:\n33\t    - phase\n34\t    - n_segments\n35\t    - ii_median\n36\t    - ii_mean\n37\t    - ii_ci_low\n38\t    - ii_ci_high\n39\t    rows:\n40\t    - - high\n41\t      - 6261\n42\t      - 0.035\n43\t      - 0.42\n44\t      - 0.12\n45\t      - 0.95\n46\t    - - mid\n47\t      - 2185\n48\t      - 0.28\n49\t      - 1.95\n50\t      - 1.45\n51\t      - 2.62\n52\t    - - low\n53\t      - 5128\n54\t      - 1.85\n55\t      - 12.8\n56\t      - 10.2\n57\t      - 15.9\n58\t  figures_description:\n59\t  - 'Phase gradient bar chart: 三 phase II median 值递增但绝对量级弱于 MATH-500 同 sparsity (MATH\n60\t    1.50 vs GPQA 1.85 — 仅 1.23× 而非预期 ~3×)'\n61\t  analysis: 虽然 monotonic 且显著，但 median_diff 仅 1.82，低于 MATH-500 同 sparsity 的 1.48 ×\n62\t    3(GPQA序列长度比) 的预期。暗示 GPQA 上 phase gradient 的 scaling behavior 不同于 MATH-500。\n63\t- name: gpqa_ds_importance_s025\n64\t  plan_id: gpqa_ds_importance_s025\n65\t  description: GPQA importance masking s=0.25, DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B, n=198\n66\t  expected_results:\n67\t    n_problems: 198\n68\t    high_median_ii: 0.082\n69\t    mid_median_ii: 0.65\n70\t    low_median_ii: 2.58\n71\t    median_diff_low_minus_high: 2.498\n72\t    wilcoxon_p: 8.1e-32\n73\t    cohens_dz: 0.81\n74\t    ci_low: 2.05\n75\t    ci_high: 3.12\n76\t    monotonic: true\n77\t    phase_gradient_direction: low > mid > high\n78\t    dose_response_rho_s015_to_s025: 1.0\n79\t    growth_factor_vs_s020: 1.38\n80\t  result_rationale: s025 在 GPQA 上仍保持 monotonic，但增长率急剧放缓 (s020→s025 仅 1.38× vs MATH-500\n81\t    同区间 3.3×)。机制：GPQA 问题在 s025 compound sparsity 下，模型的 reasoning pathway 开始崩溃——不再尝试深度推理而转为浅层\n82\t    pattern matching。这导致 low-sparsity phase 的 'reasoning content' 本身变少 (模型生成更短的 CoT)，压缩了\n83\t    phase 间的 II 差异。同时 high-sparsity phase 的 II 也在上升 (0.013→0.035→0.082)，表明 compound\n84\t    interaction 开始渗透到 answer phase。\n85\t  tables:\n86\t  - name: GPQA DS Importance s025 Phase II\n87\t    columns:\n88\t    - phase\n89\t    - n_segments\n90\t    - ii_median\n91\t    - ii_mean\n92\t    - ii_ci_low\n93\t    - ii_ci_high\n94\t    rows:\n95\t    - - high\n96\t      - 6261\n97\t      - 0.082\n98\t      - 0.98\n99\t      - 0.45\n100\t      - 1.72\n101\t    - - mid\n102\t      - 2185\n103\t      - 0.65\n104\t      - 4.8\n105\t      - 3.2\n106\t      - 6.9\n107\t    - - low\n108\t      - 5128\n109\t      - 2.58\n110\t      - 28.5\n111\t      - 21.3\n112\t      - 37.8\n113\t  figures_description:\n114\t  - 'Dose-response curve (GPQA): s015→s020→s025 median_diff = 0.95, 1.82, 2.50 — 曲线明显\n115\t    concave (增长率递减) vs MATH-500 的 convex 加速增长'\n116\t  analysis: 关键信号：GPQA gradient 增长 sub-linear 且远弱于 MATH-500。如果 s030 继续减速或反转，将确认 non-monotonicity。\n117\t- name: gpqa_ds_importance_s030\n118\t  plan_id: gpqa_ds_importance_s030\n119\t  description: GPQA importance masking s=0.30, DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B, n=198\n120\t  expected_results:\n121\t    n_problems: 198\n122\t    high_median_ii: 0.155\n123\t    mid_median_ii: 0.82\n124\t    low_median_ii: 2.12\n125\t    median_diff_low_minus_high: 1.965\n126\t    wilcoxon_p: 3.7e-25\n127\t    cohens_dz: 0.62\n128\t    ci_low: 1.42\n129\t    ci_high: 2.68\n130\t    monotonic: true\n131\t    phase_gradient_direction: low > mid > high\n132\t    dose_response_rho_full: 0.8\n133\t    growth_factor_vs_s025: 0.79\n134\t    non_monotonic: true\n135\t    non_monotonic_note: median_diff DECREASES from s025 (2.50) to s030 (1.97) — gradient\n136\t      SHRINKS at extreme sparsity\n137\t  result_rationale: Non-monotonicity 的机制：s030 extreme compound sparsity 导致 GPQA 上\n138\t    BOTH phases 的 perplexity 飙升至 catastrophic level (both_ppl > 200 在 low phase)。此时\n139\t    low-sparsity phase 的 II 增长遇到 ceiling effect (模型输出接近 random tokens，II 计算中的 ppl_both\n140\t    分子/分母同时爆炸导致 ratio 压缩)，而 high-sparsity phase 的 II 继续上升 (因为 answer phase 也开始严重受损)。净效果：phase\n141\t    间差异反而缩小。这与 recency s030 的 numerical instability 观察一致 (D102)，表明 extreme sparsity\n142\t    下 phase gradient 本身变得 unreliable。GPQA 比 MATH-500 更早触及此 ceiling 因为其 baseline perplexity\n143\t    更高 (dense low-phase ppl 1.42 vs MATH 1.23)。\n144\t  tables:\n145\t  - name: GPQA DS Importance Dose-Response (Worst Tier)\n146\t    columns:\n147\t    - sparsity\n148\t    - median_diff\n149\t    - growth_factor\n150\t    - cohens_dz\n151\t    - monotonic\n152\t    rows:\n153\t    - - s015\n154\t      - 0.947\n155\t      - '-'\n156\t      - 0.68\n157\t      - true\n158\t    - - s020\n159\t      - 1.815\n160\t      - 1.92×\n161\t      - 0.72\n162\t      - true\n163\t    - - s025\n164\t      - 2.498\n165\t      - 1.38×\n166\t      - 0.81\n167\t      - true\n168\t    - - s030\n169\t      - 1.965\n170\t      - 0.79×\n171\t      - 0.62\n172\t      - NON-MONOTONIC (reversal)\n173\t  - name: Spearman ρ comparison across benchmarks\n174\t    columns:\n175\t    - benchmark\n176\t    - model\n177\t    - dose_response_rho\n178\t    - note\n179\t    rows:\n180\t    - - MATH-500\n181\t      - DeepSeek\n182\t      - 1.0\n183\t      - perfect monotonic\n184\t    - - MATH-500\n185\t      - Qwen\n186\t      - 1.0\n187\t      - perfect monotonic\n188\t    - - GSM8K\n189\t      - DeepSeek\n190\t      - 1.0\n191\t      - perfect monotonic\n192\t    - - GSM8K\n193\t      - Qwen\n194\t      - 1.0\n195\t      - perfect monotonic\n196\t    - - GPQA\n197\t      - DeepSeek\n198\t      - 0.8\n199\t      - NON-MONOTONIC at s030\n200\t  figures_description:\n201\t  - 'Four-panel dose-response: MATH-500 convex acceleration vs GPQA concave deceleration\n202\t    + reversal at s030。视觉上 GPQA curve ''rolls over'' 而非持续上升'\n203\t  - 'Phase II heatmap (sparsity × phase): GPQA s030 的 high-phase II 显著升高 (0.155 vs\n204\t    s015 的 0.013)，表明 compound damage 向 answer phase 扩散'\n205\t  analysis: 这是 worst tier 的核心证据：GPQA importance gradient 在 s030 出现 non-monotonicity\n206\t    (ρ=0.8)，直接否定了 'monotonic dose-response' 作为 universal property。解释为 ceiling effect\n207\t    + catastrophic collapse——strategy specificity 的前提 (importance gradient 远强于 random)\n208\t    在 extreme GPQA compound 条件下不成立。\n209\t- name: gpqa_ds_random_s020\n210\t  plan_id: gpqa_ds_random_s020\n211\t  description: GPQA random masking s=0.20, DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B, n=198\n212\t  expected_results:\n213\t    n_problems: 198\n214\t    high_median_ii: 0.028\n215\t    mid_median_ii: 0.35\n216\t    low_median_ii: 1.42\n217\t    median_diff_low_minus_high: 1.392\n218\t    wilcoxon_p: 5.2e-22\n219\t    cohens_dz: 0.58\n220\t    ci_low: 1.05\n221\t    ci_high: 1.82\n222\t    monotonic: true\n223\t    phase_gradient_significant: true\n224\t    imp_rand_ratio_s020: 1.3\n225\t  result_rationale: GPQA random eviction 在 s020 产生显著 phase gradient (d_z=0.58 > 0.5\n226\t    threshold)，与 MATH-500 s020 random 的 NS 结果 (median_diff=-0.016, FAIL) 形成鲜明对比。机制：GPQA\n227\t    推理链极长 (~6000 tokens)，low-sparsity phase 占据大量序列位置。Random eviction 在长序列上有更高概率命中关键\n228\t    reasoning token——这是一个纯粹的 combinatorial effect (更长序列 = 更多 critical tokens = 随机删除更可能破坏推理链)，与\n229\t    importance score 的 discriminability 无关。换言之，GPQA 的 phase gradient 主要由 'phase duration\n230\t    asymmetry × random hit probability' 驱动，而非 strategy-specific discrimination collapse。imp/rand\n231\t    ratio 仅 1.30× 表明 importance 相比 random 几乎没有额外的 phase-specific damage——所谓 'strategy\n232\t    specificity' 在 GPQA 上 collapse。\n233\t  tables:\n234\t  - name: GPQA Random s020 vs Importance s020\n235\t    columns:\n236\t    - strategy\n237\t    - high_median\n238\t    - low_median\n239\t    - median_diff\n240\t    - dz\n241\t    - p\n242\t    rows:\n243\t    - - importance\n244\t      - 0.035\n245\t      - 1.85\n246\t      - 1.815\n247\t      - 0.72\n248\t      - '2.5e-28'\n249\t    - - random\n250\t      - 0.028\n251\t      - 1.42\n252\t      - 1.392\n253\t      - 0.58\n254\t      - '5.2e-22'\n255\t    - - ratio (imp/rand)\n256\t      - '-'\n257\t      - '-'\n258\t      - 1.30×\n259\t      - 1.24×\n260\t      - '-'\n261\t  - name: Strategy Specificity Cross-Benchmark Comparison\n262\t    columns:\n263\t    - benchmark\n264\t    - model\n265\t    - sparsity\n266\t    - imp/rand_ratio\n267\t    - interpretation\n268\t    rows:\n269\t    - - MATH-500\n270\t      - DeepSeek\n271\t      - s025\n272\t      - 15.5×\n273\t      - strong specificity\n274\t    - - MATH-500\n275\t      - DeepSeek\n276\t      - s030\n277\t      - 16.6×\n278\t      - strong specificity\n279\t    - - MATH-500\n280\t      - Qwen (n=500)\n281\t      - s025\n282\t      - 2.7×\n283\t      - weak specificity\n284\t    - - GSM8K\n285\t      - DeepSeek\n286\t      - s025\n287\t      - 3.8×\n288\t      - moderate\n289\t    - - GSM8K\n290\t      - DeepSeek\n291\t      - s030\n292\t      - 2.8×\n293\t      - weak\n294\t    - - GPQA\n295\t      - DeepSeek\n296\t      - s020\n297\t      - 1.30×\n298\t      - NO specificity\n299\t    - - LLaMA\n300\t      - LLaMA-8B\n301\t      - s025\n302\t      - 2.0×\n303\t      - weak\n304\t  figures_description:\n305\t  - 'Paired comparison: GPQA importance vs random phase gradient 几乎重叠 (ratio 1.3×)，视觉上无法区分——与\n306\t    MATH-500 DeepSeek 的 clear separation (15×) 形成 stark contrast'\n307\t  - 'Cross-benchmark strategy specificity heatmap: 仅 MATH-500 DeepSeek 一个 cell 显示强\n308\t    specificity (>10×)，其余 5/6 条件均 ≤3.8×'\n309\t  analysis: GPQA random 的强 phase gradient 确认：phase vulnerability 是 compound sparsity\n310\t    的 intrinsic property (universal)，不是 importance strategy 的 specific behavior。核心叙事必须重构。\n311\t- name: gpqa_ds_random_s015\n312\t  plan_id: gpqa_ds_random_s015_planned\n313\t  description: GPQA random masking s=0.15, DeepSeek (needed for complete ratio comparison)\n314\t  expected_results:\n315\t    n_problems: 198\n316\t    high_median_ii: 0.015\n317\t    mid_median_ii: 0.18\n318\t    low_median_ii: 0.72\n319\t    median_diff_low_minus_high: 0.705\n320\t    wilcoxon_p: 8.3e-16\n321\t    cohens_dz: 0.52\n322\t    ci_low: 0.48\n323\t    ci_high: 0.95\n324\t    monotonic: true\n325\t    phase_gradient_significant: true\n326\t    imp_rand_ratio_s015: 1.34\n327\t  result_rationale: 即使在低 sparsity s015，GPQA random 已显示显著 phase gradient (d_z=0.52)。对比\n328\t    MATH-500 s015 random 完全 NS (median_diff=0.0095, FAIL)。原因同上：GPQA 序列长度导致 random\n329\t    eviction 的 combinatorial hit probability 在 low-sparsity reasoning phase 远高于 MATH-500。imp/rand\n330\t    ratio 1.34× 表明在所有 GPQA sparsity level 上 strategy specificity 都不成立。\n331\t  tables: []\n332\t  figures_description:\n333\t  - 'GPQA random dose-response: s015=0.71, s020=1.39 — 本身已是 monotonic increasing，且与\n334\t    importance 几乎平行增长'\n335\t  analysis: 与 MATH-500 random s015 NS 的 qualitative difference 确认 phase gradient universality\n336\t    是 task/sequence-length dependent 而非 strategy-specific。\n337\t- name: gpqa_ds_random_s025\n338\t  plan_id: gpqa_ds_random_s025_planned\n339\t  description: GPQA random masking s=0.25, DeepSeek (needed for full dose-response)\n340\t  expected_results:\n341\t    n_problems: 198\n342\t    high_median_ii: 0.065\n343\t    mid_median_ii: 0.72\n344\t    low_median_ii: 1.95\n345\t    median_diff_low_minus_high: 1.885\n346\t    wilcoxon_p: 1.1e-26\n347\t    cohens_dz: 0.62\n348\t    ci_low: 1.48\n349\t    ci_high: 2.35\n350\t    monotonic: true\n351\t    imp_rand_ratio_s025: 1.33\n352\t  result_rationale: Random s025 的 median_diff (1.89) 甚至接近 importance s025 (2.50)。ratio\n353\t    仅 1.33×。在 MATH-500 s025 上 imp/rand ratio 是 15.5× (DS n=500)。这一 ~12× 的 ratio 衰减\n354\t    (15.5→1.33) 彻底瓦解了 strategy specificity 作为 general finding 的地位。机制：GPQA 问题的 attention\n355\t    score landscape 在 s025 compound 条件下已极度 flat (discrimination collapse 更彻底)，导致 importance\n356\t    eviction 退化为 quasi-random——两种 strategy 在行为上趋同。\n357\t  tables:\n358\t  - name: 'GPQA Dose-Response: Importance vs Random'\n359\t    columns:\n360\t    - sparsity\n361\t    - imp_median_diff\n362\t    - rand_median_diff\n363\t    - ratio\n364\t    - MATH500_ratio\n365\t    rows:\n366\t    - - s015\n367\t      - 0.947\n368\t      - 0.705\n369\t      - 1.34×\n370\t      - 28.1× (NS)\n371\t    - - s020\n372\t      - 1.815\n373\t      - 1.392\n374\t      - 1.30×\n375\t      - 38.6× (NS)\n376\t    - - s025\n377\t      - 2.498\n378\t      - 1.885\n379\t      - 1.33×\n380\t      - 15.5×\n381\t    - - s030\n382\t      - 1.965\n383\t      - 1.62\n384\t      - 1.21×\n385\t      - 16.6×\n386\t  figures_description:\n387\t  - '双轴 ribbon plot: importance 和 random 的 phase gradient 在 GPQA 上近乎重叠 (narrow ribbon)，在\n388\t    MATH-500 上大幅分离 (wide ribbon)'\n389\t  analysis: Strategy specificity 在 GPQA 全 4 个 sparsity 上均 <1.5×。这是 worst tier 的 decisive\n390\t    evidence。\n391\t- name: gpqa_ds_random_s030\n392\t  plan_id: gpqa_ds_random_s030_planned\n393\t  description: GPQA random masking s=0.30, DeepSeek (needed for full picture)\n394\t  expected_results:\n395\t    n_problems: 198\n396\t    high_median_ii: 0.12\n397\t    mid_median_ii: 0.85\n398\t    low_median_ii: 1.74\n399\t    median_diff_low_minus_high: 1.62\n400\t    wilcoxon_p: 7.8e-20\n401\t    cohens_dz: 0.53\n402\t    ci_low: 1.15\n403\t    ci_high: 2.18\n404\t    monotonic: true\n405\t    imp_rand_ratio_s030: 1.21\n406\t    random_also_non_monotonic: true\n407\t    random_rho: 0.8\n408\t  result_rationale: Random 在 s030 同样出现增长放缓 (s025 1.89 → s030 1.62, growth factor 0.86×)，与\n409\t    importance 的 non-monotonicity 平行。这进一步确认：non-monotonicity 不是 importance-specific\n410\t    behavior 而是 GPQA + extreme sparsity 的 ceiling/collapse effect。两种 strategy 的 phase\n411\t    gradient 同步衰减表明驱动因素是 task-level 的 (reasoning chain 在 extreme compound sparsity\n412\t    下崩溃导致 phase structure 本身消失)，而非 strategy-level 的。imp/rand ratio 在 s030 降至最低 (1.21×)——strategy\n413\t    完全不可区分。\n414\t  tables:\n415\t  - name: GPQA Random Full Dose-Response\n416\t    columns:\n417\t    - sparsity\n418\t    - median_diff\n419\t    - dz\n420\t    - p\n421\t    - monotonic_cumulative\n422\t    rows:\n423\t    - - s015\n424\t      - 0.705\n425\t      - 0.52\n426\t      - '8.3e-16'\n427\t      - 'yes'\n428\t    - - s020\n429\t      - 1.392\n430\t      - 0.58\n431\t      - '5.2e-22'\n432\t      - 'yes'\n433\t    - - s025\n434\t      - 1.885\n435\t      - 0.62\n436\t      - '1.1e-26'\n437\t      - 'yes'\n438\t    - - s030\n439\t      - 1.62\n440\t      - 0.53\n441\t      - '7.8e-20'\n442\t      - NON-MONOTONIC (peak at s025)\n443\t  figures_description:\n444\t  - 'Overlay plot: GPQA importance 和 random dose-response 曲线几乎完全重合，两者都在 s025 reach\n445\t    peak 后在 s030 回落'\n446\t  analysis: Random 和 importance 的 parallel non-monotonicity 是 worst tier 最强证据——任何基于\n447\t    'strategy-specific' 的 narrative 都无法解释为什么两种完全不同的 eviction 方法产生相同的 dose-response\n448\t    shape。\n449\t- name: cross_benchmark_strategy_specificity_synthesis\n450\t  plan_id: synthesis_analysis\n451\t  description: 综合分析：跨 4 benchmarks × 3 models 的 strategy specificity 汇总\n452\t  expected_results:\n453\t    conditions_with_strong_specificity: 1\n454\t    conditions_with_moderate_specificity: 1\n455\t    conditions_with_weak_or_no_specificity: 5\n456\t    cross_benchmark_gradient_correlation: 0.72\n457\t    strategy_specificity_fraction: 1/7 (14%)\n458\t    expected_reviewer_avg_score: 2.8\n459\t    novelty_score: 2.7\n460\t  result_rationale: '汇总所有条件后，''strategy-specific phase interaction'' 仅在单一条件 (MATH-500\n461\t    DeepSeek, 15-17×) 成立。其余 6/7 条件的 imp/rand ratio 均 ≤3.8×，其中 GPQA 全部 <1.5×。Reviewers\n462\t    会合理质疑：如果核心 claim 仅在一个 (model, benchmark) pair 上强，这是 robust finding 还是 idiosyncratic\n463\t    artifact？cross_benchmark_gradient_correlation 0.72 表明 phase gradient 本身跨 benchmark\n464\t    存在 (moderate correlation)，但 strategy modulation 不 generalizable。预期 reviewer scores:\n465\t    Novelty 2.7 (phase gradient universality 有一定新意但被视为 ''obvious once you measure\n466\t    it'')，Soundness 3.0 (统计严格)，Significance 2.5 (practical impact unclear without\n467\t    method paper)，Overall 2.8。'\n468\t  tables:\n469\t  - name: Strategy Specificity Summary (All Conditions)\n470\t    columns:\n471\t    - benchmark\n472\t    - model\n473\t    - best_sparsity_ratio\n474\t    - classification\n475\t    rows:\n476\t    - - MATH-500\n477\t      - DeepSeek-7B\n478\t      - 15.5-16.6×\n479\t      - STRONG\n480\t    - - MATH-500\n481\t      - Qwen-7B (n=500)\n482\t      - 2.7×\n483\t      - WEAK\n484\t    - - MATH-500\n485\t      - LLaMA-8B (n=250)\n486\t      - 2.0-2.6×\n487\t      - WEAK\n488\t    - - GSM8K\n489\t      - DeepSeek-7B\n490\t      - 2.3-3.8×\n491\t      - MODERATE-WEAK\n492\t    - - GSM8K\n493\t      - Qwen-7B\n494\t      - ~2.5×\n495\t      - WEAK\n496\t    - - GPQA\n497\t      - DeepSeek-7B\n498\t      - 1.2-1.3×\n499\t      - NONE\n500\t  - name: Revised Paper Claim Structure (Worst Tier)\n501\t    columns:\n502\t    - claim\n503\t    - status_revision\n504\t    - note\n505\t    rows:\n506\t    - - Phase gradient universality\n507\t      - PRIMARY (upgraded)\n508\t      - All strategies (except recency) show phase gradient on all benchmarks\n509\t    - - Strategy specificity\n510\t      - SECONDARY (downgraded)\n511\t      - Only MATH-500 DeepSeek; task/architecture dependent\n512\t    - - Recency as phase-robust control\n513\t      - PRIMARY (retained)\n514\t      - 'Still unique: only strategy with NS across all sparsities'\n515\t    - - Discrimination collapse\n516\t      - MECHANISM (retained)\n517\t      - Explains why importance ≥ random even when ratio small\n518\t    - - Dose-response monotonicity\n519\t      - QUALIFIED\n520\t      - Holds for MATH-500/GSM8K; non-monotonic on GPQA at extreme sparsity\n521\t  figures_description:\n522\t  - 'Strategy specificity heatmap (benchmark × model): 颜色编码 imp/rand ratio。仅左上角一个\n523\t    cell (MATH-500/DS) 为深色 (>10×)，其余浅色 (<4×)。GPQA row 全为最浅色 (<1.5×)'\n524\t  - 'Reframed narrative diagram: ''universal phase vulnerability'' 为中心节点，''strategy\n525\t    modulation'' 为弱 secondary edge，''recency immunity'' 为 key exception'\n526\t  analysis: 在 worst tier 下，论文需要完全重构。核心贡献变为：(1) 首次量化 compound sparsity 的 phase vulnerability\n527\t    是 universal property (所有 non-recency strategy 在所有 benchmark 上均显示)，(2) recency\n528\t    作为唯一 immune strategy 的 practical design implication，(3) strategy specificity 作为\n529\t    task/architecture-dependent secondary phenomenon。Reviewer 预期反应：'interesting empirical\n530\t    observation but incremental—once you measure phase gradient for random you see\n531\t    it's not strategy-specific, so the whole discrimination collapse story becomes\n532\t    auxiliary rather than central。' Expected score ~2.8, borderline for EMNLP。需要加强\n533\t    practical implication (e.g., phase-aware compression guideline) 来弥补 novelty 不足。\n534\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3f896323-60fc-4ef4-9510-2f7bdb97c62d","uuid":"91d4d47f-5a53-4f48-8f04-849e957fb830","timestamp":"2026-05-17T04:04:39.707Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_11/projects/phase-gated-compound-sparse/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260517T032843/worst/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: '核心叙事从 ''strategy-specific phase interaction'' 重构为 ''universal\n  phase vulnerability in compound sparsity''。GPQA 数据显示 random eviction 产生与 importance\n  可比拟的 phase gradient (ratio <1.5×)，且 importance gradient 在 s025→s030 出现 non-monotonicity。Strategy\n  specificity 仅在 MATH-500 DeepSeek 上强 (15-17×)，其余条件均 ≤3×。新 angle: phase vulnerability\n  universality 本身是 novel characterization；recency 作为唯一 phase-robust strategy 的 practical\n  implication；discrimination collapse 解释 importance≥random 的微弱优势。'\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: gpqa_ds_importance_s020\n  plan_id: gpqa_ds_importance_s020\n  description: GPQA importance masking s=0.20, DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B, n=198\n  expected_results:\n    n_problems: 198\n    high_median_ii: 0.035\n    mid_median_ii: 0.28\n    low_median_ii: 1.85\n    median_diff_low_minus_high: 1.815\n    wilcoxon_p: 2.5e-28\n    cohens_dz: 0.72\n    ci_low: 1.52\n    ci_high: 2.18\n    monotonic: true\n    phase_gradient_direction: low > mid > high\n    median_ratio_low_high: 52.9\n  result_rationale: GPQA 问题的推理链平均 ~6000 tokens (远长于 MATH-500 ~1200)，导致 low-sparsity\n    phase 中可被 evict 的 critical token 绝对数量远多于 MATH-500。s020 compound interaction 在\n    GPQA 上产生 median_diff ~1.8，虽然方向与 MATH-500 一致 (MATH-500 s020=1.21)，但增长率从 MATH-500\n    的 s015→s020 3.1× 压缩为 GPQA 的 1.9×。原因：GPQA 多学科内容 (physics/chem/bio) 的 attention\n    pattern 比纯数学推理更分散，head pruning 后的 discrimination collapse 在 s015 时已较充分——进一步增加\n    sparsity 的边际 collapse 效应递减。\n  tables:\n  - name: GPQA DS Importance s020 Phase II\n    columns:\n    - phase\n    - n_segments\n    - ii_median\n    - ii_mean\n    - ii_ci_low\n    - ii_ci_high\n    rows:\n    - - high\n      - 6261\n      - 0.035\n      - 0.42\n      - 0.12\n      - 0.95\n    - - mid\n      - 2185\n      - 0.28\n      - 1.95\n      - 1.45\n      - 2.62\n    - - low\n      - 5128\n      - 1.85\n      - 12.8\n      - 10.2\n      - 15.9\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Phase gradient bar chart: 三 phase II median 值递增但绝对量级弱于 MATH-500 同 sparsity (MATH\n    1.50 vs GPQA 1.85 — 仅 1.23× 而非预期 ~3×)'\n  analysis: 虽然 monotonic 且显著，但 median_diff 仅 1.82，低于 MATH-500 同 sparsity 的 1.48 ×\n    3(GPQA序列长度比) 的预期。暗示 GPQA 上 phase gradient 的 scaling behavior 不同于 MATH-500。\n- name: gpqa_ds_importance_s025\n  plan_id: gpqa_ds_importance_s025\n  description: GPQA importance masking s=0.25, DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B, n=198\n  expected_results:\n    n_problems: 198\n    high_median_ii: 0.082\n    mid_median_ii: 0.65\n    low_median_ii: 2.58\n    median_diff_low_minus_high: 2.498\n    wilcoxon_p: 8.1e-32\n    cohens_dz: 0.81\n    ci_low: 2.05\n    ci_high: 3.12\n    monotonic: true\n    phase_gradient_direction: low > mid > high\n    dose_response_rho_s015_to_s025: 1.0\n    growth_factor_vs_s020: 1.38\n  result_rationale: s025 在 GPQA 上仍保持 monotonic，但增长率急剧放缓 (s020→s025 仅 1.38× vs MATH-500\n    同区间 3.3×)。机制：GPQA 问题在 s025 compound sparsity 下，模型的 reasoning pathway 开始崩溃——不再尝试深度推理而转为浅层\n    pattern matching。这导致 low-sparsity phase 的 'reasoning content' 本身变少 (模型生成更短的 CoT)，压缩了\n    phase 间的 II 差异。同时 high-sparsity phase 的 II 也在上升 (0.013→0.035→0.082)，表明 compound\n    interaction 开始渗透到 answer phase。\n  tables:\n  - name: GPQA DS Importance s025 Phase II\n    columns:\n    - phase\n    - n_segments\n    - ii_median\n    - ii_mean\n    - ii_ci_low\n    - ii_ci_high\n    rows:\n    - - high\n      - 6261\n      - 0.082\n      - 0.98\n      - 0.45\n      - 1.72\n    - - mid\n      - 2185\n      - 0.65\n      - 4.8\n      - 3.2\n      - 6.9\n    - - low\n      - 5128\n      - 2.58\n      - 28.5\n      - 21.3\n      - 37.8\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Dose-response curve (GPQA): s015→s020→s025 median_diff = 0.95, 1.82, 2.50 — 曲线明显\n    concave (增长率递减) vs MATH-500 的 convex 加速增长'\n  analysis: 关键信号：GPQA gradient 增长 sub-linear 且远弱于 MATH-500。如果 s030 继续减速或反转，将确认 non-monotonicity。\n- name: gpqa_ds_importance_s030\n  plan_id: gpqa_ds_importance_s030\n  description: GPQA importance masking s=0.30, DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B, n=198\n  expected_results:\n    n_problems: 198\n    high_median_ii: 0.155\n    mid_median_ii: 0.82\n    low_median_ii: 2.12\n    median_diff_low_minus_high: 1.965\n    wilcoxon_p: 3.7e-25\n    cohens_dz: 0.62\n    ci_low: 1.42\n    ci_high: 2.68\n    monotonic: true\n    phase_gradient_direction: low > mid > high\n    dose_response_rho_full: 0.8\n    growth_factor_vs_s025: 0.79\n    non_monotonic: true\n    non_monotonic_note: median_diff DECREASES from s025 (2.50) to s030 (1.97) — gradient\n      SHRINKS at extreme sparsity\n  result_rationale: Non-monotonicity 的机制：s030 extreme compound sparsity 导致 GPQA 上\n    BOTH phases 的 perplexity 飙升至 catastrophic level (both_ppl > 200 在 low phase)。此时\n    low-sparsity phase 的 II 增长遇到 ceiling effect (模型输出接近 random tokens，II 计算中的 ppl_both\n    分子/分母同时爆炸导致 ratio 压缩)，而 high-sparsity phase 的 II 继续上升 (因为 answer phase 也开始严重受损)。净效果：phase\n    间差异反而缩小。这与 recency s030 的 numerical instability 观察一致 (D102)，表明 extreme sparsity\n    下 phase gradient 本身变得 unreliable。GPQA 比 MATH-500 更早触及此 ceiling 因为其 baseline perplexity\n    更高 (dense low-phase ppl 1.42 vs MATH 1.23)。\n  tables:\n  - name: GPQA DS Importance Dose-Response (Worst Tier)\n    columns:\n    - sparsity\n    - median_diff\n    - growth_factor\n    - cohens_dz\n    - monotonic\n    rows:\n    - - s015\n      - 0.947\n      - '-'\n      - 0.68\n      - true\n    - - s020\n      - 1.815\n      - 1.92×\n      - 0.72\n      - true\n    - - s025\n      - 2.498\n      - 1.38×\n      - 0.81\n      - true\n    - - s030\n      - 1.965\n      - 0.79×\n      - 0.62\n      - NON-MONOTONIC (reversal)\n  - name: Spearman ρ comparison across benchmarks\n    columns:\n    - benchmark\n    - model\n    - dose_response_rho\n    - note\n    rows:\n    - - MATH-500\n      - DeepSeek\n      - 1.0\n      - perfect monotonic\n    - - MATH-500\n      - Qwen\n      - 1.0\n      - perfect monotonic\n    - - GSM8K\n      - DeepSeek\n      - 1.0\n      - perfect monotonic\n    - - GSM8K\n      - Qwen\n      - 1.0\n      - perfect monotonic\n    - - GPQA\n      - DeepSeek\n      - 0.8\n      - NON-MONOTONIC at s030\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Four-panel dose-response: MATH-500 convex acceleration vs GPQA concave deceleration\n    + reversal at s030。视觉上 GPQA curve ''rolls over'' 而非持续上升'\n  - 'Phase II heatmap (sparsity × phase): GPQA s030 的 high-phase II 显著升高 (0.155 vs\n    s015 的 0.013)，表明 compound damage 向 answer phase 扩散'\n  analysis: 这是 worst tier 的核心证据：GPQA importance gradient 在 s030 出现 non-monotonicity\n    (ρ=0.8)，直接否定了 'monotonic dose-response' 作为 universal property。解释为 ceiling effect\n    + catastrophic collapse——strategy specificity 的前提 (importance gradient 远强于 random)\n    在 extreme GPQA compound 条件下不成立。\n- name: gpqa_ds_random_s020\n  plan_id: gpqa_ds_random_s020\n  description: GPQA random masking s=0.20, DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B, n=198\n  expected_results:\n    n_problems: 198\n    high_median_ii: 0.028\n    mid_median_ii: 0.35\n    low_median_ii: 1.42\n    median_diff_low_minus_high: 1.392\n    wilcoxon_p: 5.2e-22\n    cohens_dz: 0.58\n    ci_low: 1.05\n    ci_high: 1.82\n    monotonic: true\n    phase_gradient_significant: true\n    imp_rand_ratio_s020: 1.3\n  result_rationale: GPQA random eviction 在 s020 产生显著 phase gradient (d_z=0.58 > 0.5\n    threshold)，与 MATH-500 s020 random 的 NS 结果 (median_diff=-0.016, FAIL) 形成鲜明对比。机制：GPQA\n    推理链极长 (~6000 tokens)，low-sparsity phase 占据大量序列位置。Random eviction 在长序列上有更高概率命中关键\n    reasoning token——这是一个纯粹的 combinatorial effect (更长序列 = 更多 critical tokens = 随机删除更可能破坏推理链)，与\n    importance score 的 discriminability 无关。换言之，GPQA 的 phase gradient 主要由 'phase duration\n    asymmetry × random hit probability' 驱动，而非 strategy-specific discrimination collapse。imp/rand\n    ratio 仅 1.30× 表明 importance 相比 random 几乎没有额外的 phase-specific damage——所谓 'strategy\n    specificity' 在 GPQA 上 collapse。\n  tables:\n  - name: GPQA Random s020 vs Importance s020\n    columns:\n    - strategy\n    - high_median\n    - low_median\n    - median_diff\n    - dz\n    - p\n    rows:\n    - - importance\n      - 0.035\n      - 1.85\n      - 1.815\n      - 0.72\n      - '2.5e-28'\n    - - random\n      - 0.028\n      - 1.42\n      - 1.392\n      - 0.58\n      - '5.2e-22'\n    - - ratio (imp/rand)\n      - '-'\n      - '-'\n      - 1.30×\n      - 1.24×\n      - '-'\n  - name: Strategy Specificity Cross-Benchmark Comparison\n    columns:\n    - benchmark\n    - model\n    - sparsity\n    - imp/rand_ratio\n    - interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - MATH-500\n      - DeepSeek\n      - s025\n      - 15.5×\n      - strong specificity\n    - - MATH-500\n      - DeepSeek\n      - s030\n      - 16.6×\n      - strong specificity\n    - - MATH-500\n      - Qwen (n=500)\n      - s025\n      - 2.7×\n      - weak specificity\n    - - GSM8K\n      - DeepSeek\n      - s025\n      - 3.8×\n      - moderate\n    - - GSM8K\n      - DeepSeek\n      - s030\n      - 2.8×\n      - weak\n    - - GPQA\n      - DeepSeek\n      - s020\n      - 1.30×\n      - NO specificity\n    - - LLaMA\n      - LLaMA-8B\n      - s025\n      - 2.0×\n      - weak\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Paired comparison: GPQA importance vs random phase gradient 几乎重叠 (ratio 1.3×)，视觉上无法区分——与\n    MATH-500 DeepSeek 的 clear separation (15×) 形成 stark contrast'\n  - 'Cross-benchmark strategy specificity heatmap: 仅 MATH-500 DeepSeek 一个 cell 显示强\n    specificity (>10×)，其余 5/6 条件均 ≤3.8×'\n  analysis: GPQA random 的强 phase gradient 确认：phase vulnerability 是 compound sparsity\n    的 intrinsic property (universal)，不是 importance strategy 的 specific behavior。核心叙事必须重构。\n- name: gpqa_ds_random_s015\n  plan_id: gpqa_ds_random_s015_planned\n  description: GPQA random masking s=0.15, DeepSeek (needed for complete ratio comparison)\n  expected_results:\n    n_problems: 198\n    high_median_ii: 0.015\n    mid_median_ii: 0.18\n    low_median_ii: 0.72\n    median_diff_low_minus_high: 0.705\n    wilcoxon_p: 8.3e-16\n    cohens_dz: 0.52\n    ci_low: 0.48\n    ci_high: 0.95\n    monotonic: true\n    phase_gradient_significant: true\n    imp_rand_ratio_s015: 1.34\n  result_rationale: 即使在低 sparsity s015，GPQA random 已显示显著 phase gradient (d_z=0.52)。对比\n    MATH-500 s015 random 完全 NS (median_diff=0.0095, FAIL)。原因同上：GPQA 序列长度导致 random\n    eviction 的 combinatorial hit probability 在 low-sparsity reasoning phase 远高于 MATH-500。imp/rand\n    ratio 1.34× 表明在所有 GPQA sparsity level 上 strategy specificity 都不成立。\n  tables: []\n  figures_description:\n  - 'GPQA random dose-response: s015=0.71, s020=1.39 — 本身已是 monotonic increasing，且与\n    importance 几乎平行增长'\n  analysis: 与 MATH-500 random s015 NS 的 qualitative difference 确认 phase gradient universality\n    是 task/sequence-length dependent 而非 strategy-specific。\n- name: gpqa_ds_random_s025\n  plan_id: gpqa_ds_random_s025_planned\n  description: GPQA random masking s=0.25, DeepSeek (needed for full dose-response)\n  expected_results:\n    n_problems: 198\n    high_median_ii: 0.065\n    mid_median_ii: 0.72\n    low_median_ii: 1.95\n    median_diff_low_minus_high: 1.885\n    wilcoxon_p: 1.1e-26\n    cohens_dz: 0.62\n    ci_low: 1.48\n    ci_high: 2.35\n    monotonic: true\n    imp_rand_ratio_s025: 1.33\n  result_rationale: Random s025 的 median_diff (1.89) 甚至接近 importance s025 (2.50)。ratio\n    仅 1.33×。在 MATH-500 s025 上 imp/rand ratio 是 15.5× (DS n=500)。这一 ~12× 的 ratio 衰减\n    (15.5→1.33) 彻底瓦解了 strategy specificity 作为 general finding 的地位。机制：GPQA 问题的 attention\n    score landscape 在 s025 compound 条件下已极度 flat (discrimination collapse 更彻底)，导致 importance\n    eviction 退化为 quasi-random——两种 strategy 在行为上趋同。\n  tables:\n  - name: 'GPQA Dose-Response: Importance vs Random'\n    columns:\n    - sparsity\n    - imp_median_diff\n    - rand_median_diff\n    - ratio\n    - MATH500_ratio\n    rows:\n    - - s015\n      - 0.947\n      - 0.705\n      - 1.34×\n      - 28.1× (NS)\n    - - s020\n      - 1.815\n      - 1.392\n      - 1.30×\n      - 38.6× (NS)\n    - - s025\n      - 2.498\n      - 1.885\n      - 1.33×\n      - 15.5×\n    - - s030\n      - 1.965\n      - 1.62\n      - 1.21×\n      - 16.6×\n  figures_description:\n  - '双轴 ribbon plot: importance 和 random 的 phase gradient 在 GPQA 上近乎重叠 (narrow ribbon)，在\n    MATH-500 上大幅分离 (wide ribbon)'\n  analysis: Strategy specificity 在 GPQA 全 4 个 sparsity 上均 <1.5×。这是 worst tier 的 decisive\n    evidence。\n- name: gpqa_ds_random_s030\n  plan_id: gpqa_ds_random_s030_planned\n  description: GPQA random masking s=0.30, DeepSeek (needed for full picture)\n  expected_results:\n    n_problems: 198\n    high_median_ii: 0.12\n    mid_median_ii: 0.85\n    low_median_ii: 1.74\n    median_diff_low_minus_high: 1.62\n    wilcoxon_p: 7.8e-20\n    cohens_dz: 0.53\n    ci_low: 1.15\n    ci_high: 2.18\n    monotonic: true\n    imp_rand_ratio_s030: 1.21\n    random_also_non_monotonic: true\n    random_rho: 0.8\n  result_rationale: Random 在 s030 同样出现增长放缓 (s025 1.89 → s030 1.62, growth factor 0.86×)，与\n    importance 的 non-monotonicity 平行。这进一步确认：non-monotonicity 不是 importance-specific\n    behavior 而是 GPQA + extreme sparsity 的 ceiling/collapse effect。两种 strategy 的 phase\n    gradient 同步衰减表明驱动因素是 task-level 的 (reasoning chain 在 extreme compound sparsity\n    下崩溃导致 phase structure 本身消失)，而非 strategy-level 的。imp/rand ratio 在 s030 降至最低 (1.21×)——strategy\n    完全不可区分。\n  tables:\n  - name: GPQA Random Full Dose-Response\n    columns:\n    - sparsity\n    - median_diff\n    - dz\n    - p\n    - monotonic_cumulative\n    rows:\n    - - s015\n      - 0.705\n      - 0.52\n      - '8.3e-16'\n      - 'yes'\n    - - s020\n      - 1.392\n      - 0.58\n      - '5.2e-22'\n      - 'yes'\n    - - s025\n      - 1.885\n      - 0.62\n      - '1.1e-26'\n      - 'yes'\n    - - s030\n      - 1.62\n      - 0.53\n      - '7.8e-20'\n      - NON-MONOTONIC (peak at s025)\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Overlay plot: GPQA importance 和 random dose-response 曲线几乎完全重合，两者都在 s025 reach\n    peak 后在 s030 回落'\n  analysis: Random 和 importance 的 parallel non-monotonicity 是 worst tier 最强证据——任何基于\n    'strategy-specific' 的 narrative 都无法解释为什么两种完全不同的 eviction 方法产生相同的 dose-response\n    shape。\n- name: cross_benchmark_strategy_specificity_synthesis\n  plan_id: synthesis_analysis\n  description: 综合分析：跨 4 benchmarks × 3 models 的 strategy specificity 汇总\n  expected_results:\n    conditions_with_strong_specificity: 1\n    conditions_with_moderate_specificity: 1\n    conditions_with_weak_or_no_specificity: 5\n    cross_benchmark_gradient_correlation: 0.72\n    strategy_specificity_fraction: 1/7 (14%)\n    expected_reviewer_avg_score: 2.8\n    novelty_score: 2.7\n  result_rationale: '汇总所有条件后，''strategy-specific phase interaction'' 仅在单一条件 (MATH-500\n    DeepSeek, 15-17×) 成立。其余 6/7 条件的 imp/rand ratio 均 ≤3.8×，其中 GPQA 全部 <1.5×。Reviewers\n    会合理质疑：如果核心 claim 仅在一个 (model, benchmark) pair 上强，这是 robust finding 还是 idiosyncratic\n    artifact？cross_benchmark_gradient_correlation 0.72 表明 phase gradient 本身跨 benchmark\n    存在 (moderate correlation)，但 strategy modulation 不 generalizable。预期 reviewer scores:\n    Novelty 2.7 (phase gradient universality 有一定新意但被视为 ''obvious once you measure\n    it'')，Soundness 3.0 (统计严格)，Significance 2.5 (practical impact unclear without\n    method paper)，Overall 2.8。'\n  tables:\n  - name: Strategy Specificity Summary (All Conditions)\n    columns:\n    - benchmark\n    - model\n    - best_sparsity_ratio\n    - classification\n    rows:\n    - - MATH-500\n      - DeepSeek-7B\n      - 15.5-16.6×\n      - STRONG\n    - - MATH-500\n      - Qwen-7B (n=500)\n      - 2.7×\n      - WEAK\n    - - MATH-500\n      - LLaMA-8B (n=250)\n      - 2.0-2.6×\n      - WEAK\n    - - GSM8K\n      - DeepSeek-7B\n      - 2.3-3.8×\n      - MODERATE-WEAK\n    - - GSM8K\n      - Qwen-7B\n      - ~2.5×\n      - WEAK\n    - - GPQA\n      - DeepSeek-7B\n      - 1.2-1.3×\n      - NONE\n  - name: Revised Paper Claim Structure (Worst Tier)\n    columns:\n    - claim\n    - status_revision\n    - note\n    rows:\n    - - Phase gradient universality\n      - PRIMARY (upgraded)\n      - All strategies (except recency) show phase gradient on all benchmarks\n    - - Strategy specificity\n      - SECONDARY (downgraded)\n      - Only MATH-500 DeepSeek; task/architecture dependent\n    - - Recency as phase-robust control\n      - PRIMARY (retained)\n      - 'Still unique: only strategy with NS across all sparsities'\n    - - Discrimination collapse\n      - MECHANISM (retained)\n      - Explains why importance ≥ random even when ratio small\n    - - Dose-response monotonicity\n      - QUALIFIED\n      - Holds for MATH-500/GSM8K; non-monotonic on GPQA at extreme sparsity\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Strategy specificity heatmap (benchmark × model): 颜色编码 imp/rand ratio。仅左上角一个\n    cell (MATH-500/DS) 为深色 (>10×)，其余浅色 (<4×)。GPQA row 全为最浅色 (<1.5×)'\n  - 'Reframed narrative diagram: ''universal phase vulnerability'' 为中心节点，''strategy\n    modulation'' 为弱 secondary edge，''recency immunity'' 为 key exception'\n  analysis: 在 worst tier 下，论文需要完全重构。核心贡献变为：(1) 首次量化 compound sparsity 的 phase vulnerability\n    是 universal property (所有 non-recency strategy 在所有 benchmark 上均显示)，(2) recency\n    作为唯一 immune strategy 的 practical design implication，(3) strategy specificity 作为\n    task/architecture-dependent secondary phenomenon。Reviewer 预期反应：'interesting empirical\n    observation but incremental—once you measure phase gradient for random you see\n    it's not strategy-specific, so the whole discrimination collapse story becomes\n    auxiliary rather than central。' Expected score ~2.8, borderline for EMNLP。需要加强\n    practical implication (e.g., phase-aware compression guideline) 来弥补 novelty 不足。\n","numLines":534,"startLine":1,"totalLines":534}}}
